---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: history.html
navKey: history
section: history
crumb: History
title: History
description: A condensed timeline of ovarian cancer research milestones, alongside personal research milestones.
---
<header class="page-hero">
  <div class="supergraphic">1971</div>
  <div class="eyebrow rise rise-1">a condensed timeline</div>
  <h1 class="rise rise-2">The <em>history</em> of ovarian cancer research.</h1>
  <p class="lede rise rise-3">Major clinical and scientific milestones, alongside the moments from my own research where something clicked. The line at the bottom is mine — it grows as I go.</p>
</header>

<section class="rise rise-4">
  <div class="section-head">
    <div class="section-title">Clinical &amp; scientific milestones</div>
    <div class="section-note mono">1970 — present</div>
  </div>
  <div class="era-timeline">
    {% for era in eraTimeline %}
    <div class="era-item">
      <div class="era-dot"></div>
      <div class="era-year">{{ era.year }}</div>
      <div class="era-title">{{ era.title }}</div>
      <div class="era-body">{{ era.body }}</div>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="rise rise-5">
  <div class="section-head">
    <div class="section-title">Milestones from my research</div>
    <div class="section-note mono">ongoing — added as I go</div>
  </div>
  <div class="era-timeline" id="research-milestones">
    {% for m in milestones %}
    <div class="era-item">
      <div class="era-dot milestone"></div>
      <div class="era-year">{{ m.date }}</div>
      <div class="era-title">{{ m.title }}</div>
      <div class="era-body">{{ m.body }}</div>
      {% if m.badge %}<span class="era-badge">{{ m.badge }}</span>{% endif %}
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  <p class="lede" style="font-size:0.82rem; margin-top:18px; max-width:56ch;">
    This list is edited directly in <code>src/_data/milestones.json</code> — add a milestone (a result, a paper, a turning point) as a new entry at the end of that file and it shows up here permanently, in order.
  </p>
</section>
